desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "solidity"
	title: "源码扫描：Solidity delegatecall"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Solidity delegatecall"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-solidity-delegatecall"
	risk: "code-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-829"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
delegatecall 在当前合约上下文执行外部代码，目标地址可控时等于把控制权交出去。

该语言还没有 struct/ssa 前端。source 规则用正则扫描源码，builtin verify 会检查内嵌样例。

### 风险类型
code-injection

### 影响
命中说明文件中出现了该危险写法。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配。
### 参考
- CWE-829
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
只对固定、已审计的实现合约 delegatecall。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.sol": <<<POS
contract C { function f(address t, bytes data) public { t.delegatecall(data); } }

POS
	"safefile://ok.sol": <<<NEG
contract C { function f(address t) public { t.call(""); } }

NEG
)
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/\.delegatecall\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：Solidity delegatecall",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Solidity delegatecall",
	message: "源码扫描：Solidity delegatecall",
	risk: "code-injection",
}
